{"seq":2,"slug":"hrtf-and-binaural-rendering","title":"HRTF 与双耳渲染：头部传输函数与耳机空间化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/spatial-audio/hrtf-and-binaural-rendering","wordCount":1065,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"hrtf-与双耳渲染-头部传输函数与耳机空间化\">HRTF 与双耳渲染：头部传输函数与耳机空间化</h1><p>头部相关传输函数（Head-Related Transfer Function，HRTF）是实现耳机上真实三维空间感的核心技术。通过测量或计算声音从各方向到达耳膜的频率响应差异，HRTF 渲染能在耳机中产生精确的高度感和前后感——这是普通声像无法实现的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>HRTF（头部相关传输函数）</strong>：描述声音从特定方向到达双耳时，因头部、耳廓衍射产生的频率响应特征，每个方向一对（左/右）滤波器。</li>\n<li><strong>球谐函数插值（Spherical Harmonics Interpolation）</strong>：将 HRTF 数据库展开到球面调和基上，支持任意方向的平滑实时插值，避免方向切换时的跳变。</li>\n<li><strong>双耳渲染（Binaural Rendering）</strong>：将单声道声源信号分别与左右耳 HRTF 做卷积，输出专为耳机收听设计的双声道信号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-hrtf\">为什么需要 HRTF</h2><p>普通立体声声像只能在左右水平面产生定位感。听者识别声音来自前方还是后方、上方还是下方，依赖的是<strong>头部、耳廓对声音的衍射与反射</strong>产生的频谱特征（<strong>耳廓谱线索</strong>，Spectral Pinna Cues）。</p>\n<p>HRTF 的物理过程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    src[空间声源] --&gt; |空气传播| head[头部/耳廓\\n衍射与反射]&#10;    head --&gt; leftEar[左耳 HRTFᴸ\\n频率响应]&#10;    head --&gt; rightEar[右耳 HRTFᴿ\\n频率响应]&#10;    leftEar --&gt; leftOut[左耳输出 PCM]&#10;    rightEar --&gt; rightOut[右耳输出 PCM]\">flowchart LR\n    src[空间声源] --&gt; |空气传播| head[头部/耳廓\\n衍射与反射]\n    head --&gt; leftEar[左耳 HRTFᴸ\\n频率响应]\n    head --&gt; rightEar[右耳 HRTFᴿ\\n频率响应]\n    leftEar --&gt; leftOut[左耳输出 PCM]\n    rightEar --&gt; rightOut[右耳输出 PCM]</pre><p>HRTF 数据集捕获了数百个方向（方位角 + 仰角）下的双耳脉冲响应（BRIR），每个方向一对（左耳/右耳）滤波器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hrtf-数据集格式\">HRTF 数据集格式</h2><p>主流 HRTF 数据集：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据集</th>\n<th>受试者数</th>\n<th>方向数</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>许可</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CIPIC</td>\n<td>45 人</td>\n<td>1250 方向</td>\n<td>MATLAB</td>\n<td>学术免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MIT KEMAR</td>\n<td>1 个假人头</td>\n<td>710 方向</td>\n<td>WAV</td>\n<td>免费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SADIE II</td>\n<td>20 人</td>\n<td>1 各方向</td>\n<td>SOFA</td>\n<td>CC BY 4.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Steam Audio</td>\n<td>内置通用 HRTF</td>\n<td>多角度</td>\n<td>内部格式</td>\n<td>SDK 许可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SOFA 标准</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>HDF5</td>\n<td>开放标准</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>**SOFA（Spatially Oriented Format for Acoustics）**是目前的行业标准格式，基于 HDF5 存储 HRTF 测量数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 伪代码：加载 SOFA HRTF 数据&#10;struct HRTFDatabase {&#10;    struct Measurement {&#10;        float azimuth;    // 方位角：0-360°&#10;        float elevation;  // 仰角：-90° 到 +90°&#10;        std::vector&lt;float&gt; leftIR;   // 左耳脉冲响应&#10;        std::vector&lt;float&gt; rightIR;  // 右耳脉冲响应&#10;        int irLength;                // 通常 128-512 样本&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    std::vector&lt;Measurement&gt; measurements;&#10;    int sampleRate;&#10;&#10;    // 根据方向查找最近的测量点&#10;    const Measurement&amp; findNearest(float azimuth, float elevation) const;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 伪代码：加载 SOFA HRTF 数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HRTFDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Measurement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> azimuth;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 方位角：0-360°</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elevation;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 仰角：-90° 到 +90°</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;float></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leftIR;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 左耳脉冲响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;float></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rightIR;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 右耳脉冲响应</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> irLength;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                // 通常 128-512 样本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Measurement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measurements;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampleRate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 根据方向查找最近的测量点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Measurement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findNearest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> azimuth</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> elevation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最近邻-vs-球谐插值\">最近邻 vs 球谐插值</h2><h3 id=\"最近邻查找\">最近邻查找</h3><p>最简单的方法：找到与目标方向最近的已有测量点，直接使用其 HRTF 滤波器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"const HRTFMeasurement&amp; findNearestHRTF(const HRTFDatabase&amp; db,&#10;                                        float targetAz, float targetEl) {&#10;    float minDist = FLT_MAX;&#10;    int bestIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; db.measurements.size(); ++i) {&#10;        // 球面距离（弧度）&#10;        float dist = sphericalDistance(&#10;            db.measurements[i].azimuth, db.measurements[i].elevation,&#10;            targetAz, targetEl&#10;        );&#10;        if (dist &lt; minDist) {&#10;            minDist = dist;&#10;            bestIndex = i;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return db.measurements[bestIndex];&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 球面距离计算&#10;float sphericalDistance(float az1, float el1, float az2, float el2) {&#10;    // 转换为弧度，使用球面余弦定理&#10;    float a1 = az1 * M_PI / 180.0f, e1 = el1 * M_PI / 180.0f;&#10;    float a2 = az2 * M_PI / 180.0f, e2 = el2 * M_PI / 180.0f;&#10;&#10;    return std::acos(std::sin(e1)*std::sin(e2) +&#10;                     std::cos(e1)*std::cos(e2)*std::cos(a1-a2));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HRTFMeasurement</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findNearestHRTF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HRTFDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                        float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> targetAz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> targetEl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> minDist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FLT_MAX;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bestIndex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.measurements.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 球面距离（弧度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dist </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sphericalDistance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            db.measurements[i].azimuth, db.measurements[i].elevation,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            targetAz, targetEl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dist </span><span st